# Generated by scripts/setup-env.sh and holds locally-issued keys.
.env.local

# Per-run journey artifacts: screenshots, reference copies, diff images and the
# FAILURE.txt record for each step. Regenerated by every journey gate run, so
# committing them would be pure churn in a repo that already has a concurrent
# auto-committer — and a failing 3am run's images must never be absorbed into an
# unrelated commit. journey/references/ holds the committed, approved images;
# this directory is the raw per-run detail. Pruned to the 20 newest runs by
# journey/artifacts.mjs.
.journey-runs/
